{
  "_doc": "'Why it matters' template library. These are PREDEFINED GENERAL STATEMENTS shown as 'Rule-based context', never presented as analysis of the specific story. First matching templates win (max 2 per story). Add new ones freely; 'when' uses the rule language.",
  "maxPerStory": 2,
  "templates": [
    {
      "id": "pk-imf-agreement",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "imf"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(agree\\w*|staff-level|tranche|approv\\w*|disburse\\w*|board)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "IMF agreements and disbursements may affect Pakistan's external financing, investor confidence, government finances and exchange-rate expectations. IMF programmes usually come with conditions such as tax and energy-price measures."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-imf-general",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "imf"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "IMF talks shape Pakistan's budget, taxes and energy tariffs, because programme conditions are often passed on to consumers and businesses."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rate-up",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "interest-rates"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "up"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "A higher policy rate may raise borrowing costs, slow business investment and consumer spending, and is aimed at cooling inflation."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rate-down",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "interest-rates"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "down"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "A lower policy rate may reduce borrowing costs and support business investment and consumer spending; it can also add pressure on inflation and the rupee."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rate-general",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "interest-rates"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "The policy rate sets the cost of credit for businesses and households and is the State Bank's main tool against inflation."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-oil-up",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "oil"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "up"
          },
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "field": "countries",
                "op": "has",
                "value": "PK"
              },
              {
                "field": "majorCountry",
                "op": "eq",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Higher oil prices can raise Pakistan's import bill, transport costs and inflationary pressure, since Pakistan imports most of its oil."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-oil-down",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "oil"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "down"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Lower oil prices can ease Pakistan's import bill and transport costs, and may feed through to domestic fuel prices at the next revision."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rupee-weak",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "currency"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(depreciat\\w*|weaken\\w*|falls|slides|loses|devalu\\w*|record low)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "A weaker rupee makes imports - fuel, edible oil, machinery - more expensive and can feed inflation."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rupee-strong",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "currency"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(appreciat\\w*|strengthen\\w*|gains|rises|recovers)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "A stronger rupee lowers the cost of imports and can ease inflation, though it may hurt exporters."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-inflation-up",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "inflation"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "up"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Rising inflation reduces household purchasing power and makes a policy-rate cut less likely."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-inflation-down",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "inflation"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "down"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Easing inflation supports purchasing power and gives the State Bank room to cut rates."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-reserves",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(reserves|remittances?)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Foreign-exchange reserves and remittances determine how comfortably Pakistan can pay for imports and service external debt."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-rating",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "entities",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "moodys"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Credit-rating changes affect what Pakistan pays to borrow internationally and how foreign investors view the country."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-tax",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "tax"
          },
          {
            "field": "urgency",
            "op": "in",
            "value": [
              "breaking",
              "major"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Tax measures change costs for businesses and consumers; new levies are often linked to revenue targets agreed with the IMF."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-energy-tariff",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "energy"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "in",
            "value": [
              "up",
              "down"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Electricity and gas tariffs feed directly into household bills and business operating costs."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-india",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "hasAll",
            "value": [
              "PK",
              "IN"
            ]
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "hasAny",
            "value": [
              "conflict",
              "security",
              "diplomacy",
              "nuclear"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Pakistan-India tensions can affect security, markets and airspace. Both countries are nuclear-armed, so escalation risk is watched closely."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-afghanistan",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "hasAll",
            "value": [
              "PK",
              "AF"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Relations with Afghanistan affect border security, militancy in KP and Balochistan, and cross-border trade."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-security",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "security"
          },
          {
            "field": "urgency",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": "breaking"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Major security incidents can lead to road closures, internet suspensions and tighter security in affected areas."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-china-cpec",
      "when": {
        "any": [
          {
            "field": "entities",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "cpec"
          },
          {
            "all": [
              {
                "field": "countries",
                "op": "hasAll",
                "value": [
                  "PK",
                  "CN"
                ]
              },
              {
                "field": "topics",
                "op": "hasAny",
                "value": [
                  "pk-economy",
                  "infrastructure",
                  "trade",
                  "debt"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "China is Pakistan's largest bilateral lender and CPEC partner, so these developments touch on financing, energy projects and infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-gulf-money",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "hasAny",
            "value": [
              "SA",
              "AE",
              "QA"
            ]
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "hasAny",
            "value": [
              "pk-economy",
              "debt",
              "trade",
              "oil"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Gulf deposits, deferred-oil facilities and investment are a major support for Pakistan's external accounts."
    },
    {
      "id": "mideast-shipping",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "conflict"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(Hormuz|Red Sea|tankers?|shipping|Gulf of|strait)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Disruption to Gulf shipping routes can raise oil and freight costs worldwide. Pakistan imports most of its oil and LNG through these routes."
    },
    {
      "id": "mideast-conflict",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "conflict"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "hasAny",
            "value": [
              "IR",
              "IL",
              "SA",
              "AE",
              "QA",
              "LB",
              "SY",
              "YE",
              "IQ",
              "PS"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Middle East escalations can move oil prices and affect the millions of Pakistani workers in the Gulf whose remittances support the economy."
    },
    {
      "id": "iran-sanctions",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "IR"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "sanctions"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Sanctions on Iran affect regional energy flows and Pakistan's border trade and stalled gas-pipeline project."
    },
    {
      "id": "fed-rates",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "entities",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "fed"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "interest-rates"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "US Federal Reserve decisions move the dollar and global borrowing costs, which affects emerging-market currencies including the rupee."
    },
    {
      "id": "us-tariffs",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "US"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\btariffs?\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "US tariff changes affect global trade flows and can hit Pakistan's exports, especially textiles, directly or through supply chains."
    },
    {
      "id": "gold-move",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "gold"
          },
          {
            "field": "direction",
            "op": "in",
            "value": [
              "up",
              "down"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Gold moves with global risk sentiment and the dollar. In Pakistan, the per-tola rate is a widely watched savings benchmark."
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-regulation",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "ai"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(regulat\\w*|laws?|act|bans?|banned|rules|executive order|copyright|lawsuits?)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "AI regulation decisions shape what tools businesses can use and how quickly new capabilities spread."
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-model",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "ai"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(launch\\w*|releas\\w*|unveil\\w*|introduc\\w*|new model|GPT|Gemini|Claude)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Major AI model releases change what everyday software, including business and customer-service tools, can do."
    },
    {
      "id": "chips",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "semiconductors"
          },
          {
            "field": "text",
            "op": "matches",
            "value": "\\b(export controls?|bans?|banned|restrict\\w*|sanction\\w*|tariffs?|shortages?)\\b"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Chip export controls and shortages affect device prices and the US-China technology contest."
    },
    {
      "id": "cyber-pk",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "cyber"
          },
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Cyber incidents in Pakistan can disrupt banking, payments and government services."
    },
    {
      "id": "pk-tourism",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "countries",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "PK"
          },
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "hasAny",
            "value": [
              "tourism",
              "hotels",
              "airlines"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Tourism and travel developments affect footfall in hospitality areas such as the Galiyat and Hazara."
    },
    {
      "id": "generic-conflict",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "field": "topics",
            "op": "has",
            "value": "conflict"
          },
          {
            "field": "majorCountry",
            "op": "eq",
            "value": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Conflicts involving major powers can move energy prices, markets and diplomatic alignments that Pakistan has to navigate."
    }
  ]
}